  - remove blank line

Changes v4 -> v5:
  - Remove "items" in compatible since have only one item
  - Condense description of reg
  - Rename node
  - Split one reg into two reg items.
  - Binding go first
 
Changes v3 -> v4:
  - Fix "$id: relative path/filename doesn't match actual path or
    filename" warning

Changes v2 -> v3:
  - Remove oneOf
  - Add descriptions
  - Fix compiling warning

